{"3895850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "blu,", "steam_appid": 3895850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/3d0930c9913b4898010c019437aed151.poster.avif?t=1753463803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/3d0930c9913b4898010c019437aed151.webm?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was a narrative collection of video games that were each developed by a different person. All persons involved were given a rough idea of what themes their games should strike, but they were given complete and total creative freedom as to what to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.poster.avif?t=1753463803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.webm?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.mp4?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the games in &quot;blu,&quot; string together to form a greater narrative. It's experimental, yes, but I think out developers did an ok job. The genres of each game vary wildly, so please adapt your playstyle accordingly and prepare for anything. Ethan tells me I'm not allowed to tell you anything else...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>blu, Features:</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Sweet</strong> -<strong> </strong>roughly an hour of gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - explore each game to your heart's content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Storytelling</strong> - いろいろな言語で書かれたブルーの色合いを見たことがあるだろう？</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many, Many Genres</strong> - almost too many to count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Developed By Me</strong> - I didn't really make this game.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/3d0930c9913b4898010c019437aed151.poster.avif?t=1753463803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/3d0930c9913b4898010c019437aed151.webm?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was a narrative collection of video games that were each developed by a different person. All persons involved were given a rough idea of what themes their games should strike, but they were given complete and total creative freedom as to what to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.poster.avif?t=1753463803\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.webm?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/extras/a18a1eb26f4721407bf58d7d8d7b53ce.mp4?t=1753463803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the games in &quot;blu,&quot; string together to form a greater narrative. It's experimental, yes, but I think out developers did an ok job. The genres of each game vary wildly, so please adapt your playstyle accordingly and prepare for anything. Ethan tells me I'm not allowed to tell you anything else...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>blu, Features:</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Sweet</strong> -<strong> </strong>roughly an hour of gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - explore each game to your heart's content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Storytelling</strong> - いろいろな言語で書かれたブルーの色合いを見たことがあるだろう？</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many, Many Genres</strong> - almost too many to count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Developed By Me</strong> - I didn't really make this game.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "&quot;blu,&quot; is a narrative collection of video games that were each developed by a different person. From genres that range from action-packed FPS to calming platformer, &quot;blu,&quot; has every genre of a game anyone could ever want. Well, at least I think it does. I'm not really one of the developers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/1a2a402d0b5163ebe69eed8046c028f88da4f51a/header.jpg?t=1753463803", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895850/363649b6e6ed5d95c095f2ff0d18e19f3003bc26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753463803", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38958